<body>
    <h1>Executing Logic+ through an API request</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"ExecutingLogic+throughanAPIrequest-Summary">Summary</h1>
<p>Logic+ can be executed by API Request using Sharpen=E2=80=99s /v1/logics=
/ API</p>
<h2 id=3D"ExecutingLogic+throughanAPIrequest-Pre-Requisites">Pre-Requisites=
</h2>
<h4 id=3D"ExecutingLogic+throughanAPIrequest-1)AnAPIKeyandSecrethavebeencre=
atedinyourenvironmenttousefortherequest">1) An API Key and Secret have been=
 created in your environment to use for the request</h4><span class=3D"conf=
luence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manua=
l-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-=
20250403-183942.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"33e620a2a6bb4acb=
ed0193d782bd20b3294a2c98d18b111ea23ec4026e341d95" data-image-src=3D"https:/=
/sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4614488090/image-2025040=
3-183942.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1743705583467&amp;cacheVers=
ion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"414" data-width=3D"1531" data-unresolv=
ed-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4613898256" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-=
resource-default-alias=3D"image-20250403-183942.png" data-base-url=3D"https=
://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image=
/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4614488090" data-linked-resource=
-container-version=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"8b109efc-3ab8-47b7-a076-36d3cf96f=
89a" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"126"></span>
<p>Integrations can be found or created in Sharpen Admin configuration &gt;=
 Integrations</p>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.sharpencx.com/admin/confi=
guration/integrations/" rel=3D"nofollow">Direct Link: IZ0</a></p>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.iz1.sharpen.cx/admin/conf=
iguration/integrations/" rel=3D"nofollow">Direct Link: IZ1</a></p>
<h4 id=3D"ExecutingLogic+throughanAPIrequest-2)ALogic+hasbeencreatedandpubl=
ished,andisavailableforexecution">2) A Logic+ has been created and publishe=
d, and is available for execution</h4><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-fi=
le-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-left" alt=3D"image-20250403-184344.png"=
 width=3D"358" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"37a1374342421b7a33d92f1e30185b1bd288=
7ddf815bc68f3fd010dd07096a8b" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian=
.net/wiki/download/attachments/4614488090/image-20250403-184344.png?version=
=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1743705825543&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2=
" data-height=3D"293" data-width=3D"358" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0=
" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4614160401" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1"=
 data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alia=
s=3D"image-20250403-184344.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassia=
n.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-res=
ource-container-id=3D"4614488090" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D=
"1" data-media-id=3D"86b66fa8-f9f3-4d04-955d-2828f54ee6f6" data-media-type=
=3D"file" height=3D"293"></span>
<p>2b) Take note of the Logic ID which can be found in the URL while the Lo=
gic+ is open in the browser, e.g.</p>
<p>IZ0: =E2=80=9Chttps://app.sharpencx.com/admin/configuration/logicPlus/#/=
dashboard/<strong>0212mme95143e4t1</strong>=E2=80=9D</p>
<p>IZ1: =E2=80=9Chttps://app.iz1.sharpen.cx/admin/configuration/logicPlus/#=
/dashboard/<strong>02115986bps6btk1uj</strong>=E2=80=9D</p>
<h2 id=3D"ExecutingLogic+throughanAPIrequest-ExecutingLogic+viaAPI">Executi=
ng Logic+ via API</h2>
<p>To execute a Logic+ by API, this is done by sending the follow request.<=
/p>
<p><strong>Method:</strong></p>
<p>POST</p>
<p><strong>URL:</strong></p>
<p>IZ0: https://api.sharpen.cx/v1/logics/&lt;LogicID&gt;/execute/</p>
<p>IZ1: https://api.iz1.sharpen.cx/v1/logics/&lt;LogicID&gt;/execute/</p>
<p><strong>Headers: </strong>Using the API Key and Secret from Pre-Requisit=
es:</p>
<p>{</p>
<p>"X-API-KEY":"apiKeyGoesHere",</p>
<p>"X-API-SECRET":"apiSecretGoesHere"</p>
<p>}</p>
<p><strong>Body (Optional):</strong> You may include custom variables to be=
 subsequently used within the Logic+ execution. This is a great way to pass=
 values in, instead of needing to reach back out or perform a data dip with=
in the execution.</p>
<p>{ "customVariables": {</p>
<p>"customerPhoneNumber":"3171112222",</p>
<p>"customerAddressStreet":"123 Easy Street",</p>
<p>"PII_customerLast4SSN":"9832",</p>
<p>"salesforceRecordID":"0012F00002h5G8VQAU",</p>
<p>"salesforceCustomerLevel":"Platinum" } }</p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
